  "description": "GOVJUZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C72 H102 Dy6 N10 O30,2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.586-4.282 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.87-115.19°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C74H110Dy6N10O32.",
